Wed Sep  3 00:00:00 UTC 2026 - bolikcraft <bolikcraft@gmail.com>

- Update to 0.5.0: in SOCKS mode with the kill switch the window no
  longer shows the Connect button while the CLI reconnects, short
  network outages are no longer missed, and Vantah can write its own
  log (off by default).

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Tue Sep  2 00:00:00 UTC 2026 - bolikcraft <bolikcraft@gmail.com>

- Update to 0.4.0: traffic is now counted in SOCKS mode, window
  transparency can be set in the settings, service windows have a frame,
  and SOCKS mode is no longer reported as disconnected.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Fri Aug 14 00:00:00 UTC 2026 - bolikcraft <bolikcraft@gmail.com>

- Update to 0.3.7: a second tray icon no longer stays behind after the
  screen is unlocked or the machine wakes from sleep, quitting from the
  tray menu no longer crashes, and Avalonia is updated to 12.1.1.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Thu Aug 13 00:00:00 UTC 2026 - bolikcraft <bolikcraft@gmail.com>

- Update to 0.3.6: the interface now defaults to English, and settings are
  no longer written to the working directory when ~/.config does not exist
  yet.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Tue Aug 04 00:00:00 UTC 2026 - bolikcraft <bolikcraft@gmail.com>

- Update to 0.3.5: screens reload themselves once the VPN connects,
  aarch64 builds, session shutdown is no longer blocked.

